WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.642
Step 8 runs this chapter's tests:

2
00:00:02.642 --> 00:00:08.625
the Microsoft 365 collector block and
every Graph test in the live tests.

3
00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:10.700
Fifteen pass, none fail.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.937
The manifest lists the three
calls with their permissions.

5
00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:18.701
So, in one short lab, you've seen two
read permissions and nothing that writes,

6
00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:23.541
one Graph host per cloud with no default,
Microsoft's date kept as Microsoft's

7
00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:28.151
and the kit's rule labeled as a rule,
and a next link on another host refused.

8
00:00:28.151 --> 00:00:30.759
Delete the output folder when you're done,

9
00:00:30.759 --> 00:00:33.740
so no fixture output is
mistaken for a real run.
